{
  "id": "geo-quads",
  "chapterNumber": "6",
  "title": {
    "en": "Polygons &amp; Quadrilaterals",
    "ar": null
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Beyond the triangle lie quadrilaterals and regular polygons, each with predictable angle sums and — for the special quadrilaterals — distinctive side, angle and diagonal properties.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Polygon angles",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Interior angles of an \\( n \\)-gon sum to \\( (n-2)\\times 180^{\\circ} \\); exterior angles always sum to \\( 360^{\\circ} \\). In a parallelogram, opposite sides and opposite angles are equal and the diagonals bisect each other.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Interior sum",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (n-2)\\,180^{\\circ} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Regular interior",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{(n-2)180^{\\circ}}{n} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Exterior angle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{360^{\\circ}}{n} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Parallelogram",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "opposite angles equal",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 6.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the sum of the interior angles of an octagon.</p>\\[ (8-2)\\times 180^{\\circ}=1080^{\\circ}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 6.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find each interior angle of a regular hexagon.</p>\\[ \\frac{(6-2)\\times 180^{\\circ}}{6}=120^{\\circ}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
